      "countAsQuest:1": 1,
      "desc:8": "The Missile Silo is a GregTech multiblock that loads, fuels and fires missiles for you. A silo shot flies 25 percent farther and scatters half as much as a pad shot.\n\nBuild a 5 by 5 tower around an open 3 by 3 shaft: a Galacticraft launch pad for the shaft floor in a ring of Light or Dark Concrete, three rings of clear glass (Tinkers\u0027 Construct or EnderIO), seven rings of concrete (any finish but cobblestone) and a rim of 12 Gantry Beams. The HV controller sits in the middle glass ring. The front is five wide in the glass rings: a 3 by 3 glass window around the controller with a column of concrete or hatches on each side. Fit an Input Bus, an Input Hatch for fuel, an Energy Hatch and a Maintenance Hatch in place of wall, hatch-column, glass or floor-ring blocks. Check the controller\u0027s hologram.\n\nThe Energy Hatch sets what it launches: HV for Tier 1, EV for Tier 2, LuV for Tier 3. Feed the bus a body and a warhead and it stands the missile in the shaft. Build a Launch Control into the silo in place of any wall, hatch-column, glass or floor-ring block, one per silo: it fires that silo and no other, runs on the silo\u0027s power, and its screen names the silo.",
